{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1389930/extras/49ed07d0f8cb7e0100835587de02bfeb.avif?t=1755005902\" width=630 height=128 /></span><strong><br>Online game with a co-op story, session-based multiplayer, and customizable game modes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Play through the story campaign together</strong>, anytime \u2014 it's fully replayable with different people and approaches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Fight in competitive modes</strong> like deathmatch, capture the flag, point control, base assault, and boss battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Enjoy social modes</strong>, such as Mafia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Customize the game world</strong>, including the atmosphere, interface, weapons, visual styles, and gameplay rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Use the built-in editor</strong> to create custom maps and modes based on available objects and templates.<br><br><strong>Online play is session-based \u2014 you create your own game and invite friends or join someone else's session.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1389930?t=1755005902","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1389930/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755005902","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1389930/0b244ada00714f13e56178fd134d8ebb1feb3051/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755005902","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1389930/0b244ada00714f13e56178fd134d8ebb1feb3051/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755005902","c